---
import SocialLinks from '@/components/SocialLinks.astro';
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/site.config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Why now?"
  description={`Why ${SITE.name} started this dev space, and what it is for.`}
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">why now</p>
    <h1>Why now?</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      For a long time, my ideas stayed ideas. Turning one into something real took more time and
      energy than I had left after work, so my open-source contributions stayed at zero.
    </p>
    <p>
      LLMs changed that. Now I want to build different projects powered by LLMs, and show how each
      one was built.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site is where I share them, along with blog posts, ideas I'm thinking through, and the
      occasional sci-fi idea I can't stop thinking about.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm not an expert. I'm doing my best to put what I learn and what I think into words here.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="contact">
    <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
    <SocialLinks />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
